            },
            {
              "text": ".",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Maz’ ababa i Yerusalemu bimika Ahaziya umuhererezi wiwe ngw asubire ku ngoma yiwe, kuko ca gitero cari kizananye n’ Abarabo mu rugamba cari cishe bakuru biwe bose. Nuko Ahaziya mwene Yehoramu umwami w’ Abayuda aba ari we yima. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.22.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.22.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 22:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "2CH.21.6"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "2 Ngo 21:6",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "text": ".",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ahaziya aho yatangura kwima, yar’ amaze imyaka mirongwine n’ ibiri; araheza amara umwaka umwe i Yerusalemu ari ku ngoma. Nyina yitwa Ataliya, umwuzukuru wa Omuri. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.22.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.22.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 22:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Na we yagendera mu ngeso z’ab’ inzu ya Ahabu, kuko nyina yamugīra inama zo gukora ivyaha. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.22.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.22.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 22:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Akora ivyo Uhoraho abona kw ari bibi, nk’ ukw ab’ inzu ya Ahabu nyene bāgenda bakora, kukw ari bo basigaye ar’ abajanama biwe se amaze gutanga, bakamukwegera mu rupfu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.22.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.22.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 22:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nuko yemera inama zabo, atabara Yoramu mwene Ahabu umwami w’Abisirayeli, baja gutera Hazayeli umwami w’i Siriya i Ramoti‐gileyadi; maz’ Abasiriya bakomeretsa Yoramu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.22.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.22.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 22:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nukw aratabaruka, aja i Yezireli kugira ngw arwarirey’ izo nguma bāmukomerekereje i Rama, igihe yarwanya Hazayeli umwami w’i Siriya. Bukeye Ahaziya mwene Yehoramu umwami w’i Buyuda, amanuka i Yezireli kurāba Yoramu mwene Ahabu ukw ameze, kuko yar’ arwaye.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.22.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.22.6"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
